{"id":2147000228,"properties":{"title":"Rugghubelhütte SAC","abstract":null,"description":"The Rugghubelhütte SAC is easily accessible in summer from Engelberg via Ristis or Brunni and is ideal for families with children. Both in summer and winter, there are numerous tours and crossings to explore. The Rot Grätli, the crossing to Bannalp, is particularly popular. The hut is open from June to October and, thanks to its cosy winter rooms, offers an ideal base for exploring the mountains all year round.","r_number":2147000228,"city":"Central Switzerland","place":"Central Switzerland","tel":"+41 41 637 20 64","email":"info@rugghubel.ch","url1_link":"http://www.rugghubel.ch","photo_gallery_big":["https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731486968_1185661602.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731487162_849528472.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731488437_150199782.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731487377_1618069421.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731487377_1385167847.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731487144_362127832.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731487134_137558589.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731487162_124250258.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731487154_54364532.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731487377_1975649852.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1522855360_139816988.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1731487092_922838396.jpg"]},"geometry":{"coordinates":[46.84620809520984,8.462804798855215]}}